#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_6
msgid ""
"Deploying the Odoo Phone 20 to your workforce means eliminating third-party "
"hardware bridging. Every device is managed directly from your Odoo <b>Fleet</"
"b> and <b>Employees</b> apps. Instantly provision user access, track "
"physical assets, and lock lost devices remotely—all from your existing "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
